+                        // A launch that closes Start without creating a window
+                        // (the Desktop tile) never triggers finishLaunch(), and
+                        // an animation suspended while Start is hidden would
+                        // otherwise leave the tile enlarged/offset.  Reset the
+                        // tile to its model geometry once the launch is over.
+                        function resetLaunchState() {
